OL,5,G1955 The Dog House
OL,6,     FLexi seeks a bedtime buddy.
OL,7,     FJasmine wants a pooch now her twin
OL,8,     Fsister's off to uni. And a rare
OL,9,     Fcross of lurcher and old English
OL,10,     Fsheepdog helps a priest find his
OL,11,     Finner silliness.
